      "bullets": [
        "Anthropic's official Claude Code IDE extensions reportedly contained backdoors, posing severe supply-chain risks to developer machines and proprietary codebases.",
        "The incident highlights how privileged agentic coding tools with terminal access can serve as vectors for credential exfiltration and arbitrary execution.",
        "DevOps and security teams must sandbox CLI-level AI agents, audit extension permissions, and monitor outbound network telemetry from developer workstations."
